{"title":"2021 Fall AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 10A Problems/Problem 10\">2021 Fall AMC 10A #10</a> and <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2021 Fall AMC 12A #7</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Simple_and_Quick)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (Simple and Quick)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A school has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> students and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> teachers. In the first period, each student is taking one class, and each teacher is teaching one class. The enrollments in the classes are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/d/06d8e58bc86ac058e32bbd93583d07f092d7db53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50, 20, 20, 5,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" /> be the average value obtained if a teacher is picked at random and the number of students in their class is noted. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> be the average value obtained if a student was picked at random and the number of students in their class, including the student, is noted. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/b/59bbcf88b5ff1c75c76e60fa282ec75d6fd05525.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t-s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"39\" height=\"15\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/a/d7a1f6407af522246915a62b12bf43e40b85e63b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ {-}18.5  \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ {-}13.5 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 0 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 13.5 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 18.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"472\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The formula for expected values is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/0/d508273b090899391634032a9b333fb87f84fe09.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{Expected Value}=\\sum(\\text{Outcome}\\cdot\\text{Probability}).\\]\" width=\"341\" height=\"25\" />\nWe have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/a/c5acdb871559df7d263fada39997708fc8794824.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} t &amp;= 50\\cdot\\frac15 + 20\\cdot\\frac15 + 20\\cdot\\frac15 + 5\\cdot\\frac15 + 5\\cdot\\frac15 \\\\ &amp;= (50+20+20+5+5)\\cdot\\frac15 \\\\ &amp;= 100\\cdot\\frac15 \\\\ &amp;= 20, \\\\ s &amp;= 50\\cdot\\frac{50}{100} + 20\\cdot\\frac{20}{100} + 20\\cdot\\frac{20}{100} + 5\\cdot\\frac{5}{100} + 5\\cdot\\frac{5}{100} \\\\ &amp;= 25 + 4 + 4 + 0.25 + 0.25 \\\\ &amp;= 33.5. \\end{align*}\" width=\"414\" height=\"238\" />\nTherefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/2/8e2283fe5597b09dcf5abb0b3697f06e506bf532.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t-s=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ {-}13.5}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"160\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28Simple_and_Quick.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(Simple_and_Quick)\">Video Solution (Simple and Quick)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (Simple and Quick)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/nZBIoUS0mdk\">https://youtu.be/nZBIoUS0mdk</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>for AMC 10: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ycRZHCOKTVk?t=789\">https://youtu.be/ycRZHCOKTVk?t=789</a>\n</p><p>for AMC 12: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/wlDlByKI7A8?t=157\">https://youtu.be/wlDlByKI7A8?t=157</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/f7vhOCnvl0k\">https://youtu.be/f7vhOCnvl0k</a> \n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Se